# Never publish internal business data.
# The fleet spreadsheet contains partner wholesale pricing and margins.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.csv
*.numbers

# Archived inventory — kept locally so it can be restored, but must NEVER be
# published. GitHub Pages serves any committed file, so an archived car page
# would go live at /archive/... and could be indexed by Google.
archive/
backup-v1/
backup-pre-joon-removal-*/
backup-*/

